'' std/fs, a real module since 2026-10-10 (it was a facade over fb/filesystem.bi): FsError, an
'' enum member, Exists, PathStem and PathExtension, std/path's folded BaseName and DirName --
'' exported macros, qualified -- and FB_FSKIND_DIR, a header #define, now a public constant
'' that 'using fs' makes bare.
